@startuml
sequenceDiagram
participant C as Component
participant U as URL Handler
participant L as Localhost
participant S as Server

C->>U: Initialize with URL
U->>U: Extract path
U->>U: Build localhost URL
U->>L: HEAD request

alt Localhost resource exists
    L-->>U: 200 OK
    U->>U: Set finalUrl to localhost
else Resource not found
    L-->>U: 404 Not Found
    U->>U: Keep original server URL
end

U->>S: HEAD request to final URL
S-->>U: Return content-type

alt content-type starts with
    "image/"
    U->>C: Set mediaType to "image"
else content-type starts with
    "video/"
    U->>C: Set mediaType to "video"
else unsupported type
    U->>C: Throw error
end

C->>C: Render appropriate element

@enduml